<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's KFPC buys 49,000T Chinese corn - traders.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's KFPC buys 49,000T Chinese corn - traders.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korea Feedgrain Purchase Committee (KFPC) last Friday bought 49,000 tonnes of Chinese corn at $140.20 a tonne, C&amp;F, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>Traders said Louis Dreyfus sold the corn through a private negotiation.  </p>
<p>The purchase was split into two lots: one for 19,000 tonnes was scheduled to arrive by June 15 and the other for 30,000 tonnes by August 10.</p>
<p>Arrival was set for the western port of Inchon.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
